senses.gloss:
अप्य्-√ 1. अस् -अस्ति (1. pl. -ष्मसि; Imper. -अस्तु; Opt. -ष्यात्), Ved. (with loc. or local adv.)
to be in, be closely connected with, RV. &c.;
to belong to (as a share), RV.; ŚBr.

आ-√ प्यै Ā. -प्यायते (Impv. आ॑-प्यायस्व, AV. vii, 81, 5; aor. Subj. 1. pl. आ-प्यायिषीमहि, AV. vii, 81, 5)
to swell, increase;
to grow larger or fat or comfortable;
to thrive;
to become full or strong;
to abound, RV.; AV.; VS.; AitBr.; MBh.; Yājñ. &c.;
to make full;
to enlarge, strengthen, MBh. :
Caus. आ॑-प्याययति (AV. iv, 11, 4; aor. Subj. आ॑-पीपयन्, RV. i, 152, 6)
to cause to swell;
to make full, fill up;
to enlarge;
to cause to grow, increase;
to make fat or strong or comfortable;
to confirm, ŚBr.; AitBr.; MBh.; R.; Megh. &c.;
to help forward;
to cause to increase or get the upper hand (e.g. a disease), Suśr. &c.
